20:12:51.258 | 13.5 ARMOUR AND SHIELDS
20:12:51.259 | 
20:12:51.260 |        PREV |                                                   | NEXT
20:12:51.261 |        13.4 | WEAPONS                                SAFE ROOMS | 13.6
20:12:51.261 | 
20:12:51.262 | (For the House of the Vashnarian Shield, please see HELP HOUSE SHIELD.)
20:12:51.262 | 
20:12:51.263 | Normal armour is something you wear that protects you from both types of
20:12:51.263 | physical damage (cutting and blunt).
20:12:51.263 | 
20:12:51.264 | The basic types of armour in Achaea, aside from shields, are, in ascending
20:12:51.265 | order of effectiveness, with the best armour a class may wear listed:
20:12:51.265 | 
20:12:51.265 | 
20:12:51.266 | Armour type         Classes/Race (best armour wearable)
20:12:51.266 | -----------         ------------------------------
20:12:51.267 | Cloth               Dragon, Magi, Horkvals, Psions, Pariahs, Elemental Lords
20:12:51.268 | Leather             Monks, Bards
20:12:51.268 | Ringmail            Alchemists, Apostates
20:12:51.269 | Scalemail           Serpents, Jesters, Shamans, Occultists, Depthswalkers,
20:12:51.269 |                     Blademasters
20:12:51.271 | Chainmail           Druids, Sentinels, Sylvans, Classless
20:12:51.271 | Splintmail          Priests
20:12:51.272 | Field plate         Paladins, Infernals, Runewardens, Unnamables
20:12:51.272 | Full plate          Paladins, Infernals, Runewardens, Unnamables
20:12:51.273 | 
20:12:51.273 | 
20:12:51.274 | NOTE: the classes are listed next to the BEST armour they may wear. They may
20:12:51.274 | wear any lesser armour if desired, or none whatsoever.
20:12:51.275 | 
20:12:51.275 | The types of shields available in Achaea are, in ascending order of
20:12:51.276 | effectiveness, and with the best type of shield a class may wield listed:
20:12:51.276 | 
20:12:51.276 | 
20:12:51.277 | Shield type         Classes which may wield them
20:12:51.278 | -----------         ----------------------------
20:12:51.278 | None                Dragon, Magi, Monks, Blademasters, Pariahs, Elemental Lords
20:12:51.279 | Buckler             Serpents, Sylvans, Bards, Psions, Classless+
20:12:51.279 | Cavalry             Alchemists, Occultists, Apostates, Shamans,
20:12:51.280 |                     Depthswalkers, Classless+
20:12:51.280 | Banded              Jesters
20:12:51.281 | Kite                Priests, Druids, Sentinels
20:12:51.281 | Tower               Runewardens, Infernals, Paladins, Unnamable
20:12:51.282 | 
20:12:51.282 | + Those who have no class may wield Buckler and Cavalry shields.
20:12:51.283 | * The artefact shield of absorption may be wielded by everyone except
20:12:51.283 | blademasters.
20:12:51.284 | 
20:12:51.284 | 
20:12:51.285 | Armour Statistics
20:12:51.285 | -----------------
20:12:51.286 | Non-magical armour and shields have two armour-specific statistics: protection
20:12:51.286 | vs. cutting damage and protection vs. blunt damage. The WEAPONPROBE ability in
20:12:51.287 | the Weaponry skill will allow you to see these statistics on a piece of armour
20:12:51.288 | or on a shield.
20:12:51.288 | 
20:12:51.288 | 
20:12:51.289 | (See also: HELP ARTEFACT ARMOUR)
20:12:51.289 | 
